---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到 - 404">
  <div class="py-20 text-center">
    <span class="text-7xl font-extrabold font-mono text-sky-500">404</span>
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 mt-4 mb-2">
      抱歉，你访问的页面不存在
    </h1>
    <p class="text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">
      可能是链接地址输入有误，或者该篇博文已被迁移/更名。
    </p>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-100 dark:text-neutral-900 hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
    >
      返回首页
    </a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
